# Scripts and Make

`set -euo pipefail` on new bash. Scripts load `/root/.attic-token` when
`ATTIC_TOKEN` is unset; they refuse to start a fill or deploy if both are
missing. Token rules: `code-practices.mdc`.

Operator targets and the script each wraps are listed in
`docs/deployments.md`. Do not duplicate that table here.

- `make edit-secrets HOST=` / `make updatekeys` for sops.
- Ansible (`make deploy-proxmox-host`) is not Nix. See
  `docs/services/proxmox-host.md`.

Go under `scripts/` is built from the flake (`buildGoModule`, `vendorHash`).
Do not add modules that the flake does not vendor. Keep packages small;
match existing `encoding/json` report style in `jellyfin-io-bench`.
